                                                "sense_id": "cd5e6bf9-13e1-3027-8e59-6cca89b0998c",
                                                "text": "In addition to the ordinary type of indicator, the Author describes the Hospitalier and the Schultze manographs, in which the diagram is produced photographically by reflecting a beam of light from a mirror attached to a diaphragm […]"
